  "text": "In the present analysis, we explored the optimal treatment for LS-SCLC with bulky tumor. Our results suggested that, compared with sequential TRT plus cisplatin and intravenous etoposide, concurrent TRT plus cisplatin and oral etoposide improved PFS and OS with acceptable treatment-related toxicity in patients who had completed 3-4 cycles of induction chemotherapy and achieved remission. Multivariate analysis confirmed the PFS and OS benefit of concurrent chemoradiotherapy after induction chemotherapy, supporting a more efficient treatment strategy for LS-SCLC with bulky tumor."
}

